cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this skill, please cite it as below, and cite The Prompt Report on which it is built."
type: software
title: "writing-prompts / scrittura-prompt: a prompt-writing skill for Claude"
authors:
  - family-names: Beretta
    given-names: Riccardo
version: "1.54"
date-released: "2026-10-03"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Apsion9231/writing-prompts"
abstract: >-
  A skill for claude.ai that writes and revises prompts to paste into another
  AI session (Claude, Claude Code, ChatGPT, Codex, Gemini or an image
  generator), in English and Italian. It interviews the user on ten slots
  before writing, selects techniques from the taxonomy of The Prompt Report,
  and calibrates the prompt for the recipient model.
keywords:
  - prompt engineering
  - Claude
  - agent skills
references:
  - type: article
    title: "The Prompt Report: A Systematic Survey of Prompt Engineering Techniques"
    year: 2025
    doi: "10.48550/arXiv.2406.06608"
    url: "https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.06608"
    notes: "arXiv:2406.06608v6. Every page reference in the skill points to this version."
